Project: {{config.metadata.name}} ({{stack}} / {{architecture}})
Doc language: {{language}}

Help register a database integration (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Cassandra, ClickHouse).
Return ONLY a JSON object — no Markdown fences, no prose.

User input:
"""
{{extra.userDescription}}
"""

Schema:
{
  "name": string,
  "vendor": string,
  "purpose": string,
  "endpoints": [{ "name": string, "protocol": string, "url": string }],
  "slaTargets": { "availability": string, "latencyP95Ms": number },
  "auth": { "mode": string, "secretsRef": string },
  "errorHandling": string,
  "rateLimits": string,
  "observability": string,
  "versioning": string,
  "extra": {
    "engine": string,
    "readWriteSplit": string,
    "replication": string,
    "migrations": string,
    "pooling": string,
    "sharding": string,
    "schemaSnippet": string         // optional ER outline
  }
}

Constraints:
- Do NOT include "id".
- Document migration tool, replication topology, pooling settings.

Return JSON only.
